COLUMNAL
VERSION 3

UNITS @BEGIN UU
UU @UNIT myUnit "Custom unit for testing"
UU @UNIT hogshead "An English wine cask hogshead" = 2387/10 * l
UU @ALIAS myAlias = myUnit
@END UU UNITS

TYPES @BEGIN TT
TT @TYPE A @tagged ( Single )
TT @TYPE B @tagged ( Single )
TT @TYPE C @tagged ( Blank | Num ( Number ) )
TT @TYPE EitherMyOrHogshead @tagged ( Left ( Number { myUnit } ) | Right ( Number { hogshead } ) )
TT @TYPE EitherNumUnit @tagged @unitvar a @unitvar b ( Left ( Number { @unitvar a } ) | Right ( Number { @unitvar b } ) )
TT @TYPE Nested @tagged ( A ( A ) | C ( C ) )
@END TT TYPES
DATA @BEGIN CDB
CDB "Test 0"
CDB FORMAT @BEGIN
CDB @COLUMN GenCol 49 @TYPE @apply   Optional ( @apply   Optional ( Text ) ) @DEFAULT None
CDB @COLUMN GenCol 50 @TYPE Number {m^3/s^3} @DEFAULT 1
CDB @COLUMN GenCol 51 @TYPE Number {m^2} @DEFAULT 32917553
CDB @COLUMN GenCol 52 @TYPE @apply   EitherNumUnit {1} {m} @DEFAULT Left ( 0 )
CDB @COLUMN GenCol 53 @TYPE EitherMyOrHogshead @DEFAULT Left ( 2147483647 )
CDB @COLUMN GenCol 54 @TYPE Number {m^3/s^3} @DEFAULT 1762437616629
CDB @END FORMAT
CDB VALUES @BEGIN
CDB   None , -32768 , 45 , Right ( -128 ) , Right ( 0.383592 ) , 32767
CDB   None , 0.349187 , 532495200 , Left ( 0.950724 ) , Right ( 0.060729 ) , @INVALID "#1774749523"
CDB @END VALUES
CDB DISPLAY @BEGIN
CDB POSITION 1 1
CDB SHOWCOLUMNS ALL
CDB @END DISPLAY
@END CDB DATA
COMMENT @BEGIN MOF
MOF CONTENT @BEGIN
MOF Text fZnrZ 0 a FORMAT i0 END^nh0naZ yanZr9a99 c9
MOF @END CONTENT
MOF DISPLAY @BEGIN
MOF POSITION 1000 66 4 2
MOF @END DISPLAY
@END MOF COMMENT
